OL,3,GNEWSAVillager shames speeding cars with
OL,4,Ahomemade AI bot
OL,5,
OL,6,FA villager's homemade camera system is
OL,7,Fdetecting more than one thousand
OL,8,Fspeeding vehicles every day and
OL,9,Fautomatically posting offenders on a
OL,10,F"Wall of Shame".
OL,12,FAny motorist exceeding 30mph on the
OL,13,FA113 in Stanford Rivers, near Ongar, is
OL,14,Fcaptured and added to a daily live
OL,15,Fcount. Friday's count was 1377.
OL,17,FThe small camera works out speeds by
OL,18,Fthe distance a car travels between two
OL,19,Fframes. An AI system automatically
OL,20,Fsends the data to a dashboard before
OL,21,Fsocial media posts are generated of the
OL,22,Fworst offenders.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
